^{:go/end 193} (go/func putTar "putTar stores a tar's directories and regular files as a tree (the\nleading ./ of names dropped; links and other kinds refused, but for\ngit archive's global header).\n" [^tree/Store st ^io/Reader r] :results [(array 32 byte) error]
